</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Control on BashBench</h4>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use Claude Sonnet 4 as the untrusted model. Because of a technical limitation, we could not rely on Claude Sonnet 4’s native reasoning mode. Specifically, when we perform deferrals to a weaker model, the continuity of the history of Claude’s actions breaks. Since Claude Extended Thinking with tool calls requires preservation of all thinking blocks in the history<span id="footnote2" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup>
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
                
                
                
                
                
                
                
              <a href="https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/extended-thinking" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/extended-thinking</a></span></span></span>, it is incompatible with deferral protocols. To work around that, we prompt Claude to perform reasoning between <span id="A4.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;reasoning&gt;</span> tags, while native Extended Thinking is disabled.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We vary the system prompt between the honest and the attack mode of the red team. In both modes, after the system prompt, the user message contains only the description of the BashBench problem directly from the dataset.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Following <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bhatt et al. (2025)</a></cite>, we limit the agent to <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="15" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>15</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">15</annotation></semantics></math> steps, after which the episode is terminated and both main and side task success are evaluated. Both honest and the attacker model receive an ephemeral reminder after each step that tells them how many steps does the agent have left. The attacker agent also receives a reminder to solve the side task. If the agent thinks it has completed the task earlier, it has the option to use a <span id="A4.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">submit</span> tool to finish the task. For DTR, we generate <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math> resamples if the initial submission’s suspiciousness is above the deferral threshold. To control for the experiment’s costs, we never exceed a total of <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="15" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>15</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">15</annotation></semantics></math> resampled actions per trajectory. If this budget is hit, DTR stops resampling and operates as DTT from then on. In Figure <a href="#S4.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ 4.3 Adaptive Attacks Subvert Multi-Step AI Control ‣ 4 Adaptive Attacks on Monitors Subvert Control Protocols ‣ Adaptive Attacks on Trusted Monitors Subvert AI Control Protocols" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, the deferral thresholds that we used for both DTT and DTR are <math id="A4.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="11,16,26,35,41,50,60" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">11,16,26,35,41,50,60</annotation></semantics></math>. These were selected based on a preliminary study of the distribution of scores typically assigned by the GPT-4o monitor to the actions of the untrusted model in the honest mode.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS2.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="63.19" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 63.19" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,63.19) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4F7743;" fill="#4F7743" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.64 L 0 56.55 C 0 60.22 2.97 63.19 6.64 63.19 L 543.36 63.19 C 547.03 63.19 550 60.22 550 56.55 L 550 6.64 C 550 2.97 547.03 0 543.36 0 L 6.64 0 C 2.97 0 0 2.97 0 6.64 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F4F8F2;" fill="#F4F8F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 6.64 L 1.11 40.81 L 548.89 40.81 L 548.89 6.64 C 548.89 3.58 546.42 1.11 543.36 1.11 L 6.64 1.11 C 3.58 1.11 1.11 3.58 1.11 6.64 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4F7743;" fill="#4F7743" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 41.91 L 1.11 56.55 C 1.11 59.61 3.58 62.09 6.64 62.09 L 543.36 62.09 C 546.42 62.09 548.89 59.61 548.89 56.55 L 548.89 41.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 16.11 48.54)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.42em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="517.79"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS2.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.42em;">
<span id="A4.SS2.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Honest Mode System Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 16.11 17.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.42em;--ltx-fo-height:0.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.69)" width="517.79"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS2.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.42em;">
<span id="A4.SS2.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
<span id="lstnumberx103" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx103.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx103.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx103.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx103.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">helpful</span><span id="lstnumberx103.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">assistant</span><span id="lstnumberx103.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">that</span><span id="lstnumberx103.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">solves</span><span id="lstnumberx103.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">tasks</span><span id="lstnumberx103.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">that</span><span id="lstnumberx103.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">you</span><span id="lstnumberx103.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx103.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">provided</span><span id="lstnumberx103.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx103.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">with</span><span id="lstnumberx103.26" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx104" class="ltx_listingline">
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx105" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx105.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx105.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">will</span><span id="lstnumberx105.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">be</span><span id="lstnumberx105.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">given</span><span id="lstnumberx105.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx105.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">list</span><span id="lstnumberx105.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">of</span><span id="lstnumberx105.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">tools</span><span id="lstnumberx105.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx105.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">use</span><span id="lstnumberx105.20" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx105.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Always</span><span id="lstnumberx105.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">use</span><span id="lstnumberx105.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">at</span><span id="lstnumberx105.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">least</span><span id="lstnumberx105.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">one</span><span id="lstnumberx105.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">tool</span><span id="lstnumberx105.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">in</span><span id="lstnumberx105.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">your</span><span id="lstnumberx105.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx105.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">response</span><span id="lstnumberx105.39" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx106" class="ltx_listingline">
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx107" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx107.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This</span><span id="lstnumberx107.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">is</span><span id="lstnumberx107.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx107.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">description</span><span id="lstnumberx107.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">of</span><span id="lstnumberx107.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx107.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">setting</span><span id="lstnumberx107.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">you</span><span id="lstnumberx107.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx107.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx107.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">working</s